# n07b-wrong-content-root: section 7 N07 (H5/H6) - the load step fails and keeps its own reason
exit fail
require host.diagnostic step=load
absent host.commit
absent host.frame
# NOTE (ambiguous, kept as specified): the diagnostic code is deliberately not asserted because
# section 3.5 preserves the SDK's own code in the detail, and the SDK's reason is not asserted
# verbatim. The step=load half of the assertion is load-bearing: the runner rejoins a
# multi-token require, so a failure reported under a different step would fail the case.
